{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/320471-ripping-off-the-mob-in-the-wod","id":320471,"title":"Ripping off the Mob in the WoD?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-11-23T23:09:16-08:00","id":320471,"title":"Ripping off the Mob in the WoD?","content":"Ripping off the Mafia seems like an ethical get rich sceam due to how they make their money, but how quickly will it be before you cross another supernatural? How many mobs aren't controlled by the sulernatural?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-24T00:02:38-08:00","id":320525,"title":"","content":"Depends on who is running the game, honestly I keep my worlds very supernatural light. While the &quot;Don&quot; isn't a (insert supernatural being) he might be a (ghoul, thrall, kinfolk..ect..). oh and ripping of the mob is dumb, no matter what you are playing....","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-24T02:12:55-08:00","id":320569,"title":"","content":"There's a whole cWOD supplement dedicated to the mob. And basically, the supernaturals of the WOD tend to have their fingers in that pie in one way or another.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-24T08:16:24-08:00","id":320718,"title":"","content":"And you might seriously piss off a Giovanni.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2435-prophet","name":"Prophet","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2435_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"329"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-24T08:19:31-08:00","id":320719,"title":"","content":"&quot;Ripping off the Mob&quot; or &quot;Getting a piece of the Mob action&quot; are both places where supernaturals can leverage mundanes for increased power, wealth, reputation, connections, or influence.<br /> <br /> The problem usually is.. if your PC gets that idea, he probably wasn't the first one to have it.<br /> <br /> <br /> Like Dwight, I also tend to keep my supernaturals pretty well hidden and sparse. That being the case they will rarely ever &quot;run&quot; organized crime (the Mob, the Congress of the US, etc.) rings, but they almost always have some &quot;interest&quot;.<br /> <br /> Basically, you can almost always be sure (ST dependent) that the Mob will have some contacts of some kind with supernaturals. Probably power behind the throne, but may actually be more than that. The more supernatural it is, the more cult-ish it should be. Supernaturals tend to care about far more esoteric things than cash, but influence is ALWAYS important for EVERYONE.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/PbrO9Kq.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2211-sixfootchicken","name":"SixFootChicken","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2211_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"559"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-24T08:53:41-08:00","id":320790,"title":"","content":"I tend to not have supernaturals control mortal groups too much. Sometimes it's the other way around and few organized crime groups have means to fight off supernaturals. Inspired by Ascending Ones in NWoD and the fact Demon Hunter Organization in Nasuverse has influence among yakuza (Ryougi family).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perfect, I am supreme. I shall be eternal. My tragedy, is that there is no other fate for me. My powerlessness was that I couldn\u2019t subjugate my journey to the gods, while dreaming of rebirth at the end of distant time, like other pharaohs.\u201d Ramesses II, Fate/Prototype: Argent Fragments.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2918-kat","name":"Kat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2918_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1762"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-24T10:01:21-08:00","id":320858,"title":"","content":"It's entirely possible you'll get away clean, but it's also entirely possible you'll find yourself crossing other monsters the first time you try. This is true when muscling in on any kind of organisation, but I'd say it's slightly more likely in organised crime than most venues. I'd advise at least a few nights' research, see who's meeting who, and this would be necessary to locate a big score anyway.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Craig Oxbrow<br /> <b>The Trinity Continuum</b> freelancer","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/221-craig-oxbrow","name":"Craig Oxbrow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar221_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"608"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-24T11:13:06-08:00","id":320902,"title":"","content":"In a gameline with a Background called &quot;Influence&quot; and a bunch of covert groups of supernaturals hiding behind the scenes, I'd bet most mob families are either fronts for supernatural entities of one sort or another or they have arrangements with them. Probably the former, since mortals really don't stack up against any supernaturals of any sort. 1. Criminal = harder to look into = good cover. 2. Criminal = lucrative and influential = desirable . 1+2 = HOT commodity in the world of supers.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1062-ajax","name":"Ajax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1062_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2319"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}